set{\\to }{OL}$ via the vectors $s$ and $t.$\n\n$\\,\\overset{\\to }{OL}=$\n{{field-1}}\n$s+$\n{{field-2}}\n$t$" 13194139533704 true] [17592186247691 1113 #uuid "9b4d713f-1d80-5450-80b8-4fa07a5cf04b" 13194139533704 true] [17592186247691 1138 false 13194139533704 true] [17592186247691 1145 "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OL}=\\overset{\\to }{OS}+\\overset{\\to }{SL}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OS}=s,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{SL}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OST,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{ST} & =\\overset{\\to }{SO}+\\overset{\\to }{OT} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OS}+\\overset{\\to }{OT} \\\\  & =-s+t \\\\  & =t-s.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $SL:LT=11:4,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{SL}=\\frac{11}{15}\\overset{\\to }{ST}=\\frac{11}{15}(t-s).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OL} & =\\overset{\\to }{OS}+\\overset{\\to }{SL} \\\\  & =s+\\frac{11}{15}(t-s) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{15}s+\\frac{11}{15}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533704 true] [17592186247692 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247693 13194139533704 true] [17592186247692 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533704 true] [17592186247692 1041 "field-1" 13194139533704 true] [17592186247692 1104 #edb/ref 17592186247693 13194139533704 true] [17592186247692 1110 #uuid "57644421-8dba-531a-b578-d218cbf56c15" 13194139533704 true] [17592186247693 1034 "\\frac{4}{15}" 13194139533704 true] [17592186247693 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533704 true] [17592186247693 1111 #uuid "20190404-fcaa-57f2-aafa-897dab3e7c93" 13194139533704 true] [17592186247694 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247695 13194139533704 true] [17592186247694 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533704 true] [17592186247694 1041 "field-2" 13194139533704 true] [17592186247694 1104 #edb/ref 17592186247695 13194139533704 true] [17592186247694 1110 #uuid "f61050a1-81bd-58bb-95c1-89560f62a7b0" 13194139533704 true] [17592186247695 1034 "\\frac{11}{15}" 13194139533704 true] [1759218624